      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "Already some time has passed since the event “ Persistent Identifiers in Research – Celebrating 10 Years of DOI Desk at ETH Zurich ” took place on 13 September 2019. Speakers from different fields of expertise talked about the various aspects of persistent identifiers: from current applications, developments to future initiatives.\n\n#KnowHow – ETH Library’s infrastructure and tools lead you to your goal."
